LICENSES & CONSUMER AFFAIRS, BOARD OF PUBLIC WORKS, PUBLIC HEALTH, SEATTLE
CENTER.

EXCLUDED :
CLERICAL EMPLOYEES OF ALL OTHER CITY OF SEATTLE
DEPARTMENTS.

